{"uid":"7512dfe7ad75f6b1","name":"test_hold_does_not_run_completion_hook","fullName":"tests.test_on_complete_cmd#test_hold_does_not_run_completion_hook","historyId":"b494056b54deb3a3fa12c805f759e7ad","time":{"start":1791891794870,"stop":1791891796190,"duration":1320},"description":"B.3/operator ruling 3 (v0.24, #169, cure-01-02): a real engine that\n    enters `timed_out` (the hold) must skip `on_complete_cmd` entirely --\n    running the operator's completion hook on a hold would falsely tell it\n    the job is over -- and must exit through its ordinary shutdown cleanup\n    (release the protected dirs, close the lock, return) even with\n    `on_complete: idle`, never idle forever waiting for a signal that a\n    genuinely-finished run would have been waiting for. Forces the hold via\n    the same plain-budget-exhaustion shape `test_budget_exhaustion_fails_job`\n    (tests/test_e2e.py) and the superseded node above used to use.","descriptionHtml":"<p>B.3/operator ruling 3 (v0.24, #169, cure-01-02): a real engine that<br />\nenters <code>timed_out</code> (the hold) must skip <code>on_complete_cmd</code> entirely --<br />\nrunning the operator's completion hook on a hold would falsely tell it<br />\nthe job is over -- and must exit through its ordinary shutdown cleanup<br />\n(release the protected dirs, close the lock, return) even with<br />\n<code>on_complete: idle</code>, never idle forever waiting for a signal that a<br />\ngenuinely-finished run would have been waiting for. Forces the hold via<br />\nthe same plain-budget-exhaustion shape <code>test_budget_exhaustion_fails_job</code><br />\n(tests/test_e2e.py) and the superseded node above used to use.</p>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"event_loop_policy","time":{"start":1791891119391,"stop":1791891119391,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shou